OL,3,GNEWSAAmazon warehouse could affect A1,
OL,4,Asays councillor
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans for an Amazon fulfilment centre
OL,7,Fthat could create about 2,000 jobs
OL,8,Fwould have a huge impact on a town's
OL,9,Froad network, a councillor said.
OL,11,FAmazon submitted a planning application
OL,12,Fto Central Bedfordshire Council for the
OL,13,Frobotics-enabled facility at Symmetry
OL,14,FPark on Stratton Business Park,
OL,15,FBiggleswade, earlier this year.
OL,17,FThe facility would be positioned next
OL,18,Fto the A1 and have an internal
OL,19,Ffootprint of about 1.4 million sq ft
OL,20,F(130,064 sq m).
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
