OL,3,GNEWSAAmazon warehouse could affect A1,
OL,4,Asays councillor
OL,5,
OL,6,FGrant Fage, a Conservative councillor
OL,7,Ffor Biggleswade East, which includes
OL,8,Fthe business park, said: "This is a
OL,9,Fvery complicated application and will
OL,10,Fhave huge impacts on Biggleswade,
OL,11,Fpositively in terms of job creation but
OL,12,Fnegatively for our road network."
